{
  "results": [
    {
      "n": "G1",
      "evidence": "All five screenshots show the 3D French toast scene fully rendered in Chrome with no blank screen or errors.",
      "pass": true
    },
    {
      "n": "G2",
      "evidence": "Screenshots 2–5 show orbiting and zooming around the stack, and OrbitControls sets maxPolarAngle = Math.PI * 0.465 and maxDistance = 15.5, preventing the camera from going below the ground or outside the scene (though zooming out in screenshot 5 reveals the black void beyond the tablecloth edge).",
      "pass": true
    },
    {
      "n": "G3",
      "evidence": "Once the procedural 512x512 textures finish baking on load, the runtime loop renders modest geometry (~60k vertices total, one InstancedMesh for sugar, one Points cloud) with two shadow maps (2048 and 1024) and EffectComposer (UnrealBloomPass + BokehPass), which easily sustains 30+ fps on a standard laptop.",
      "pass": true
    },
    {
      "n": "1",
      "evidence": "All five screenshots display an on-screen UI bar at the bottom ('Drag to orbit · Scroll to zoom', 'Macro DoF: ON', and 'Hero Angle' buttons), and the code also includes a loading text overlay.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "2",
      "evidence": "The animate() loop in the HTML source only updates OrbitControls, camera reset lerping, and BokehPass focus distance; there is no environmental motion running on load.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "3",
      "evidence": "Screenshot 1 shows a close-up, slightly elevated camera angle with the French toast stack centered on the dark plate, matching the reference photo's framing.",
      "pass": true
    },
    {
      "n": "4",
      "evidence": "Screenshots 1–3 show three slices of French toast stacked and rotated at offset angles relative to one another, matching the arrangement in the photo.",
      "pass": true
    },
    {
      "n": "5",
      "evidence": "Screenshots 1–4 show banana slices on top, tucked between the toast layers, and resting on the plate at the left and front of the stack.",
      "pass": true
    },
    {
      "n": "6",
      "evidence": "Screenshots 1–4 show blueberries clustered on top of the stack, between slices, and scattered around the base on the plate.",
      "pass": true
    },
    {
      "n": "7",
      "evidence": "Screenshots 1 and 5 show the stack on a dark round plate resting on a warm grey-brown textured cloth, though in the photo the cloth is visible at the front-bottom whereas in screenshot 1 it appears at the top-back.",
      "pass": true
    },
    {
      "n": "8",
      "evidence": "Screenshots 1 and 4 show white powdered sugar specks dusted across the dark plate, blueberries, and top toast surface.",
      "pass": true
    },
    {
      "n": "9",
      "evidence": "In screenshots 1–4, the toast slices look like molded, scalloped square crackers or tart shells with uniform vertical fluted ridges all the way around rather than thick slices of bread with soft cut edges.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "10",
      "evidence": "Screenshots 1 and 4 show round banana discs with a faint Y-shaped seeded pattern in the center, though several slices suffer from severe dark rendering/transmissive sorting artifacts around their rims.",
      "pass": true
    },
    {
      "n": "11",
      "evidence": "Screenshots 1–4 show round blueberries of slightly varying sizes with distinct 5-pointed calyx crowns sculpted at their tops.",
      "pass": true
    },
    {
      "n": "12",
      "evidence": "While nothing floats in mid-air, several blueberries and banana slices visibly intersect and sink into the toast geometry rather than resting cleanly on top (e.g., screenshots 1–3).",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "13",
      "evidence": "In screenshots 2, 3, and 5, orbiting reveals the back edge of the tablecloth ending abruptly against a pitch-black void, and transmissive syrup meshes create transparent cutout-like visual artifacts through the bananas and toast.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "14",
      "evidence": "In screenshot 1 and the code (`keyLight.position.set(-5.2, 8.4, 5.4)`), the main key light comes from the front-left rather than behind-left, and the syrup rivulets appear dark reddish-brown with weak highlights compared to the bright window-lit speculars in the photo.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "15",
      "evidence": "Despite `BokehPass` being enabled (`maxblur: 0.0065`), screenshot 1 shows almost no perceptible depth-of-field blur—the back rim of the plate, distant sugar dots, and cloth horizon line remain fairly sharp compared to the creamy bokeh in the reference photo.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "16",
      "evidence": "Screenshots 1–3 show very little soft contact shadowing grounding the blueberries and banana slices on the plate and toast, making the foreground berries look bright and pasted against the plate.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "17",
      "evidence": "In screenshot 1, the top strip of the frame above the tablecloth horizon is pure pitch black (`#0e0d0c` / `#161412` background void).",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "18",
      "evidence": "In screenshots 1 and 5, the syrup drips on the toast crust and puddles on the plate look like opaque, dark brown-orange plastic tubes and flat shapes rather than glossy, translucent amber liquid with bright specular highlights.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "19",
      "evidence": "In screenshots 1–4, the toast has smooth, airbrushed gradient coloring from pale yellow centers to uniform brown scalloped edges, lacking realistic uneven caramelisation or porous bread crumb at cut edges.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "20",
      "evidence": "In screenshots 1–4, the blueberries have a blotchy, high-contrast blue-and-white camo-like texture rather than a natural dusty matte wax bloom with soft highlights.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "21",
      "evidence": "In screenshots 1 and 4, the banana slices look flat, matte greyish-beige with dark rim artifacts (caused by transmissive syrup interaction) rather than moist, creamy, and slightly translucent fruit.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "22",
      "evidence": "Screenshots 1–4 show the plate with a dark ceramic sheen and screenshot 5 shows subtle woven texture on the cloth, though the plate also exhibits a strange bright circular ring artifact around the stack.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "23",
      "evidence": "Screenshots 1 and 5 confirm that the plate and tablecloth rest horizontally level with no unintended tilt.",
      "pass": true
    },
    {
      "n": "24",
      "evidence": "In `addCrustSyrupRivulets` and `animate()`, the syrup tubes are completely static meshes with no dripping or flowing animation.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "25",
      "evidence": "Neither the screenshots nor the HTML source contain any steam or warm haze particle system or shader.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "26",
      "evidence": "There is no environmental or object motion implemented in `animate()` at all.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "27",
      "evidence": "Although `createBlueberry` and `createBananaSlice` vary vertex noise slightly by seed, every blueberry shares the exact same `berryTex` UV texture and every banana shares one of two `CanvasTexture` maps, so adjacent berries on top in screenshot 4 show noticeably repeated blotch patterns.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "28",
      "evidence": "Screenshots 1, 2, and 3 clearly show blueberries and banana slices clipping directly into the toast slices and intersecting each other.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "29",
      "evidence": "In screenshots 1–5, the powdered sugar on the plate reads as scattered, oversized hard white polka-dots/beads (`IcosahedronGeometry(0.015, 0)` scaled up to 1.45x) rather than fine, soft powdered sugar.",
      "pass": false
    },
    {
      "n": "30",
      "evidence": "Screenshot 1 looks immediately like stylized, plastic-like 3D graphics with scalloped cracker-shaped toast, polka-dot sugar, dark transparency artifacts on the bananas, a pitch-black sky bar at the top, and an on-screen UI bar, not passing for the reference photo.",
      "pass": false
    }
  ]
}
